{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ pages of Serre goodness. Also includes some comics of Arlette and Oaxa's adventures after the game ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc1d To find the artbook when you've bought it, find Serre in your Steam Library, right click, go to Local Files, Browse, and you should find the PDF there! \ud83d\udc1d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you still can't find it, you might need to change the game's language. Go to your Steam Library, right click the game, and change the game's language to English, and the artbook should now be in your Local Files. You can revert the language then!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585980?t=1744239718","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585980/f9e327fdc353db9e75c9ddc3a5b4a7f040b4047c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744239718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585980/7fefc659a90aa983167de305446e95e5c169e894/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744239718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585980/7fefc659a90aa983167de305446e95e5c169e894/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744239718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">50+ pages of Serre goodness. Also includes some comics of Arlette and Oaxa's adventures after the game ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc1d To find the artbook when you've bought it, find Serre in your Steam Library, right click, go to Local Files, Browse, and you should find the PDF there! \ud83d\udc1d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb